    <!-- Icons: Font Awesome Free (CC BY 4.0) — see README.md "Icons" section and
         planning/refinement-strategy.md "Before publishing" for the attribution
         requirement. Native SVG viewBoxes are 640x512 (battery, cloud-sun),
         576x512 (shoe-prints, sun, cloud, stairs), 512x512 (heart,
         cloud-rain, cloud-bolt, snowflake, gauge, message), 448x512 (fire,
         stopwatch, person-running), 320x512 (temperature-half);
         scaleX/scaleY below rasterize them at their drawn size, aspect-correct
         (field icons 16px tall, battery 20px), since the resource compiler
         otherwise rasterizes at native SVG size. -->
